.TH QUIPU-ASOF-RDF 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-asof\-rdf \- Convert one retained as\-of share into bounded coherent RDF chunks offline
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu asof\-rdf\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-binding\fR] [\fB\-\-frames\fR] [\fB\-\-scratch\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert one retained as\-of share into bounded coherent RDF chunks offline
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-binding\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Private JSON cut/profile binding and finite resource limits
.TP
\fB\-\-frames\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Private retained event/data JSONL file, with exact transport data strings
.TP
\fB\-\-scratch\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Empty canonical private directory matching SQLITE_TMPDIR
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
